- deduplicationKey

This collection is for persistent reminder evaluation and duplicate prevention.

Do not implement FCM or actual push delivery in this phase.

Implement only the current in-app reminder functionality and the existing reminder evaluation logic.

## 7.11 auditEvents collection

Path:

auditEvents/{eventId}

Fields:

- eventId
- actorUid
- actorRole
- actionType
- entityType
- entityId
- taskId
- employeeId
- description
- previousValue
- newValue
- createdAt

Important actions must generate audit records.

Examples:
- Employee created.
