# 24. Performance and Firestore Cost Awareness

Build the application efficiently.

- Do not continuously fetch every collection.
- Use pagination.
- Use targeted queries.
- Avoid unnecessary realtime listeners.
- Unsubscribe listeners on unmount.
- Avoid repeatedly recalculating all dashboard data.
- Use efficient Firestore indexes.
- Avoid N+1 query patterns where practical.
- Do not load unrelated employee records into employee dashboards.
- Use TanStack Query caching and invalidation appropriately.

Design for an initial organization of approximately 50 employees while keeping the architecture extensible.

Do not claim unlimited free Firebase usage.

Do not create unnecessary high-frequency database reads or writes.

